{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id1236251641"}, "name":{"label":"cyzef"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-20T20:37:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"8.43.2"}, "id":{"label":"13772001275"}, "title":{"label":"Quá tệ"}, "content":{"label":"Tôi đã đặt vé và thanh toán nhưng giao dịch lại không thành công. Sau đó tôi phải chờ rất lâu mới được hoàn tiền hiện giờ vẫn chưa nhận được, gây mất thời gian và ảnh hưởng kế hoạch của tôi. Điều khiến tôi bức xúc nhất là nhân viên hỗ trợ nhắn tin nói rằng cáp treo bị hư, trong khi thực tế không hề có sự cố như vậy. Việc cung cấp thông tin không trung thực cho khách hàng là không thể chấp nhận. Trải nghiệm rất tệ và tôi không hài lòng với cách xử lý của Trip.com.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=681752345&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id1069329818"}, "name":{"label":"Uy Phan"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-20T01:02:46-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"8.43.2"}, "id":{"label":"13768985700"}, "title":{"label":"Confirmed ticket missing in airline system – serious booking failure"}, "content":{"label":"My experience with this case was highly unsatisfactory. My original confirmed flight was scheduled for 10 February. It was then changed to 9 February, and based on this update I had to rearrange my plans and adjust my schedule accordingly. I formally accepted this change through the Trip.com system and prepared to travel based on the updated date.\n\nHowever, upon arriving at the airport for the 9 February departure, I was informed at check-in that my booking did not exist in the airline system. At that time, the airline system showed the flight dated 10 February again — effectively reverting to the original date without proper notification. This back-and-forth change (10 → 9 → 10) caused serious disruption and should not happen with a confirmed booking.\n\nWhen I contacted Trip.com immediately after, your system still showed 9 February, while the airline system showed 10 February. This clearly indicates a data mismatch between systems rather than a simple “sudden schedule change before departure.”\n\nAlthough the $83.23 Uber reimbursement was eventually offered, it does not adequately reflect the impact of having to rearrange plans, travel unnecessarily to the airport, lose work time, and experience significant inconvenience and stress.\n\nOverall, the handling of this case did not meet reasonable service standards, and my confidence in the reliability of the booking platform has been significantly affected.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=681752345&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
